[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_00_0010","text":"哇～……这道题好难……！\n……冬优子酱，你会吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_00_0020","text":"自己再想想嘛——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_00_0030","text":"诶～……别这么说嘛～……\n制作人？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_00_0040","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_00_0004","text":"冬优子\n说得对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_00_0005","text":"就这一次啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_00_0006","text":"我看看……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_01_0010","text":"那样的话\n永远都学不会哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_01_0020","text":"连制作人都～……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_02_0010","text":"太好了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_02_0020","text":"……太宠了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_03_0010","text":"……这题好难\n我也不懂"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_05080000_03_0020","text":"真的假的……？\n这题有这么难吗……"}]
